<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>★ BOSS 战 · 命令行待办清单 —— 装备库毕业试炼</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#0d1021; --bg2:#141833; --card:#1a1f3d;
    --gold:#f5c542; --cyan:#4dd6ff; --purple:#a78bfa;
    --green:#4dd6ff; --pink:#f472b6; --orange:#fb923c;
    --red:#f87171; --text:#e8eaf6; --muted:#8b93b8; --line:#2a3060;
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{
    font-family:"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;
    background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);line-height:1.75;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 40% at 50% -10%, rgba(77,214,255,.12), transparent),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 40% 30% at 95% 90%, rgba(167,139,250,.08), transparent);
  }
  .wrap{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;padding:36px 20px 80px;}
  /* 头部 */
  .crumb{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:14px;}
  .crumb b{color:var(--green);}
  header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px;}
  .lesson-badge{
    display:inline-block;padding:4px 16px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;
    background:rgba(77,214,255,.12);color:var(--green);border:1px solid rgba(77,214,255,.35);margin-bottom:12px;
  }
  h1{
    font-size:32px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1px;
    background:linear-gradient(120deg,#7eeaff,#4dd6ff 50%,#f5c542);
    -webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;
  }
  .subtitle{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;font-size:14px;}
  .mission{
    margin-top:18px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;
    padding:16px 22px;text-align:left;font-size:14px;
  }
  .mission h3{color:var(--gold);font-size:15px;margin-bottom:6px;}
  .mission li{margin-left:18px;}
  /* 板块 */
  section{
    background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;
    padding:26px 28px;margin-bottom:26px;animation:fadeUp .6s ease both;
  }
  section:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.05s;}
  section h2{
    font-size:19px;margin-bottom:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;letter-spacing:1px;
  }
  .num{
    width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:9px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4dd6ff,#a78bfa);
    color:#0d1021;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    font-size:15px;font-weight:800;flex-shrink:0;
  }
  section p{margin-bottom:10px;}
  .hl{color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;}
  .hl-c{color:var(--cyan);font-weight:600;}
  /* 代码块 */
  .code{
    background:#0a0d1e;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;
    padding:16px 18px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
    font-size:14px;overflow-x:auto;margin:12px 0;position:relative;white-space:pre-wrap;
  }
  .code .c{color:#5b648f;}   /* 注释 */
  .code .k{color:var(--pink);} /* 关键字/函数 */
  .code .s{color:var(--green);} /* 字符串 */
  .code .n{color:var(--orange);} /* 数字 */
  .code .v{color:var(--cyan);}  /* 变量 */
  .out{
    background:#0a0d1e;border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:12px;
    padding:12px 18px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:14px;
    color:#a8ecff;margin-top:-4px;margin-bottom:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;
  }
  .out::before{content:"▶ 输出：";color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;display:block;margin-bottom:2px;}
  .out.session::before{content:"▶ 运行实录（> 开头的是你输入的命令）：";}
  .file-cap{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:-6px;margin-bottom:12px;}
  /* 作战计划卡片 */
  .boxes{display:flex;gap:16px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:20px 0;}
  .mbox{
    width:150px;background:var(--card);border:2px solid var(--cyan);border-radius:14px;
    padding:14px;text-align:center;position:relative;transition:all .3s;cursor:default;
  }
  .mbox:hover{transform:translateY(-6px) scale(1.04);box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(77,214,255,.25);}
  .mbox .tag{
    font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--cyan);
    background:rgba(77,214,255,.1);border-radius:8px;padding:2px 8px;display:inline-block;
  }
  .mbox .val{
    font-size:15px;font-weight:800;margin:8px 0 4px;color:var(--gold);word-break:break-all;
  }
  .mbox .tip{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);}
  .btn{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4dd6ff,#a78bfa);color:#0d1021;border:none;
    padding:11px 26px;border-radius:10px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;
    transition:transform .15s, box-shadow .2s;font-family:inherit;
  }
  .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(77,214,255,.3);}
  /* BOSS 需求书 */
  .boss-card{
    background:linear-gradient(140deg,#1d2448,#141833);
    border:2px solid var(--red);border-radius:16px;padding:20px 24px;margin:14px 0;
  }
  .boss-card h3{color:var(--red);font-size:17px;margin-bottom:8px;letter-spacing:1px;}
  .boss-card .req{margin:6px 0;font-size:14px;}
  .boss-card .req b{color:var(--cyan);font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;margin-right:8px;}
  /* 验收清单 */
  .check-item{
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:8px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;
  }
  .check-item:hover{border-color:var(--cyan);}
  .check-item .box{
    width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:7px;border:2px solid var(--muted);flex-shrink:0;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:15px;color:#0d1021;font-weight:800;
  }
  .check-item.done{border-color:var(--green);background:rgba(77,214,255,.08);}
  .check-item.done .box{background:var(--green);border-color:var(--green);}
  .check-item.done span{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:line-through;}
  #check-progress{font-size:14px;color:var(--cyan);font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;}
  /* 打分表 */
  .score-row{
    background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;
    padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:10px;
  }
  .score-row .sname{font-weight:700;color:var(--text);}
  .score-row .sdesc{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px;}
  .score-btns{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .sbtn{
    background:#0a0d1e;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;color:var(--text);
    padding:5px 14px;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;transition:all .2s;
  }
  .sbtn:hover{border-color:var(--cyan);}
  .sbtn.on{background:var(--green);color:#0d1021;font-weight:800;border-color:var(--green);}
  #score-total{
    margin-top:14px;text-align:center;padding:16px;border-radius:14px;
    background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--gold);display:none;
  }
  #score-total.show{display:block;animation:popIn .4s both;}
  #score-total b{font-size:32px;color:var(--gold);display:block;}
  /* 记忆卡片 */
  .cards-grid{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:16px;
  }
  .mcard{perspective:800px;height:130px;cursor:pointer;}
  .mcard-inner{position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;transition:transform .55s;transform-style:preserve-3d;}
  .mcard.flip .mcard-inner{transform:rotateY(180deg);}
  .mface{
    position:absolute;inset:0;backface-visibility:hidden;border-radius:13px;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;
    padding:12px;font-size:14px;
  }
  .mfront{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1d2448,#141833);border:1px solid var(--cyan);color:var(--cyan);font-weight:600;}
  .mback{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16284a,#101530);border:1px solid var(--gold);color:var(--text);transform:rotateY(180deg);font-size:13px;}
  .cards-tip{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px;}
  /* Quiz */
  .quiz-q{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;margin-bottom:14px;}
  .quiz-q .qq{font-size:15px;margin-bottom:10px;font-weight:600;}
  .quiz-q .qq i{color:var(--gold);font-style:normal;margin-right:6px;}
  .qq-opts{display:grid;gap:8px;}
  .qq-opt{
    background:#0a0d1e;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;color:var(--text);
    padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;transition:all .2s;font-family:inherit;
  }
  .qq-opt:hover{border-color:var(--cyan);}
  .qq-opt.right{border-color:var(--green);background:rgba(77,214,255,.15);}
  .qq-opt.wrong{border-color:var(--red);background:rgba(248,113,113,.12);}
  .qq-exp{display:none;margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);border-left:3px solid var(--gold);padding-left:12px;}
  .qq-exp.show{display:block;}
  #quiz-result{
    display:none;margin-top:16px;text-align:center;padding:18px;border-radius:14px;
    background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--gold);animation:popIn .4s both;
  }
  #quiz-result.show{display:block;}
  #quiz-result b{font-size:34px;color:var(--gold);display:block;}
  /* 通关认证 */
  .cert{
    display:none;margin-top:20px;text-align:center;
    background:linear-gradient(140deg,#1d2448,#141833);
    border:2px solid var(--gold);border-radius:18px;padding:30px 26px;
    animation:popIn .5s cubic-bezier(.2,1.4,.4,1) both;
  }
  .cert.show{display:block;}
  .cert h3{color:var(--gold);font-size:14px;letter-spacing:6px;margin-bottom:12px;}
  .cert .cert-title{font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:3px;margin-bottom:10px;}
  .cert .cert-text{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin:10px auto;max-width:520px;}
  .cert .cert-seal{
    display:inline-block;margin-top:14px;padding:6px 18px;border:1px dashed var(--gold);
    border-radius:999px;color:var(--gold);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;
  }
  .homework li{margin:8px 0 8px 18px;}
  .homework code{background:rgba(77,214,255,.1);color:var(--cyan);padding:1px 7px;border-radius:6px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;}
  footer{text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:40px;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px dashed var(--line);}
  @keyframes fadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px);}to{opacity:1;transform:none;}}
  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0;}to{opacity:1;}}
  @keyframes popIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale(.7);}to{opacity:1;transform:scale(1);}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <div class="crumb">◈ 装备库 · <b>BOSS 战 / 共 26 课</b></div>

  <header>
    <div class="lesson-badge">STAGE 2 · ARMORY · BOSS BATTLE</div>
    <h1>★ BOSS 战 · 命令行待办清单</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">装备库毕业试炼：打造你的第一个带数据持久化的完整项目</div>
    <div class="mission">
      <h3>📜 BOSS 战任务书</h3>
      <li>独立完成命令行待办清单：添加 / 完成 / 删除 / 列出任务</li>
      <li>用 <span class="hl">json</span> 文件存档，程序重启后数据不丢</li>
      <li>综合运用第 6-10 课全部装备：列表、字典、字符串、文件、异常</li>
      <li>通过功能验收 8 项 + 自评打分 + 设计决策 Quiz 5/5，赢取<span class="hl">「装备齐全的行者」</span>称号</li>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- 1 BOSS 宣言 -->
  <section>
    <h2><span class="num">1</span>🐲 BOSS 宣言 · 需求书</h2>
    <p>你一路披荆斩棘，终于惊动了装备库最深处的守关 BOSS——<span class="hl">遗忘魔龙</span>。它最擅长的招数是「记忆抹除」：你每次关掉程序，所有进度就凭空消失。</p>
    <p>想要击败它，你必须造出一件能<span class="hl-c">对抗遗忘</span>的神器——一个会把数据存进文件、下次启动还能读回来的命令行待办清单。它吐出一张需求书：</p>
    <div class="boss-card">
      <h3>🔥 遗忘魔龙 · 需求书（全部满足方可通关）</h3>
      <div class="req"><b>R1</b>添加任务：输入任务标题，加入清单</div>
      <div class="req"><b>R2</b>完成任务：输入编号，对应任务打上 ✔</div>
      <div class="req"><b>R3</b>删除任务：输入编号，对应任务从清单移除</div>
      <div class="req"><b>R4</b>列出任务：显示编号、完成状态和完成统计</div>
      <div class="req"><b>R5</b>数据持久化：任务存进 <b>todo.json</b>——启动时读取，退出时保存</div>
      <div class="req"><b>R6</b>异常防御：文件不存在或损坏时，程序不许崩溃</div>
    </div>
    <p>别慌——你已经集齐了打败它需要的全部装备。这节课我们把它们熔铸成一件完整的神器。</p>
  </section>

  <!-- 2 作战计划 -->
  <section>
    <h2><span class="num">2</span>🗺️ 作战计划 · 四层拆解</h2>
    <p>对付大项目，莽夫直接开写，勇者先画地图。把待办清单拆成四层，每层只用几个函数，一层一层搭建：</p>
    <div class="boxes">
      <div class="mbox"><div class="tag">存档层</div><div class="val">load / save</div><div class="tip">json 读写 · 第 9 课</div></div>
      <div class="mbox"><div class="tag">展示层</div><div class="val">show_tasks</div><div class="tip">enumerate + f-string · 第 6/8 课</div></div>
      <div class="mbox"><div class="tag">操作层</div><div class="val">add·done·del</div><div class="tip">列表与字典 · 第 6/7 课</div></div>
      <div class="mbox"><div class="tag">调度层</div><div class="val">main</div><div class="tip">while True + 异常 · 第 4/10 课</div></div>
    </div>
    <p>🧠 口诀：<span class="hl">自顶向下设计</span>（先想清楚分几层），<span class="hl">自底向上搭建</span>（从最独立的存档层开始写，每写完一层立刻测试）。</p>
  </section>

  <!-- 3 第1步 -->
  <section>
    <h2><span class="num">3</span>🧱 第 1 步 · 存档层：json 读写</h2>
    <p>对抗遗忘的核心装备是 <span class="hl">json</span> 模块：<span class="hl-c">json.dump()</span> 把 Python 对象写成文件，<span class="hl-c">json.load()</span> 把文件读回 Python 对象——一来一回，数据格式分毫不变。</p>
    <div class="code"><span class="k">import</span> <span class="k">json</span>

tasks = [
    {<span class="s">&quot;title&quot;</span>: <span class="s">&quot;学习变量&quot;</span>, <span class="s">&quot;done&quot;</span>: <span class="k">True</span>},
    {<span class="s">&quot;title&quot;</span>: <span class="s">&quot;闯过 BOSS 战&quot;</span>, <span class="s">&quot;done&quot;</span>: <span class="k">False</span>},
]

<span class="k">with</span> <span class="k">open</span>(<span class="s">&quot;todo.json&quot;</span>, <span class="s">&quot;w&quot;</span>, encoding=<span class="s">&quot;utf-8&quot;</span>) <span class="k">as</span> f:
    <span class="k">json</span>.<span class="k">dump</span>(tasks, f, ensure_ascii=<span class="k">False</span>, indent=<span class="n">2</span>)

<span class="k">with</span> <span class="k">open</span>(<span class="s">&quot;todo.json&quot;</span>, <span class="s">&quot;r&quot;</span>, encoding=<span class="s">&quot;utf-8&quot;</span>) <span class="k">as</span> f:
    loaded = <span class="k">json</span>.<span class="k">load</span>(f)

<span class="k">print</span>(loaded[<span class="n">0</span>][<span class="s">&quot;title&quot;</span>], <span class="s">&quot;-&quot;</span>, <span class="s">&quot;已完成&quot;</span> <span class="k">if</span> loaded[<span class="n">0</span>][<span class="s">&quot;done&quot;</span>] <span class="k">else</span> <span class="s">&quot;未完成&quot;</span>)</div>
    <div class="out">学习变量 - 已完成</div>
    <p>运行后，文件夹里会多出一个 <code class="hl-c">todo.json</code>，打开看看它的真容——人能读懂，机器也能解析：</p>
    <div class="code">[
  {
    <span class="s">&quot;title&quot;</span>: <span class="s">&quot;学习变量&quot;</span>,
    <span class="s">&quot;done&quot;</span>: <span class="k">true</span>
  },
  {
    <span class="s">&quot;title&quot;</span>: <span class="s">&quot;闯过 BOSS 战&quot;</span>,
    <span class="s">&quot;done&quot;</span>: <span class="k">false</span>
  }
]</div>
    <div class="file-cap">▲ todo.json 的内容：Python 的 True/False 存档后变成 json 的 true/false</div>
    <p>三个参数记牢：<span class="hl">ensure_ascii=False</span> 让中文原样保存不变成乱码；<span class="hl">indent=2</span> 让排版缩进好看；<span class="hl">encoding="utf-8"</span> 读写都要带，双保险防乱码。</p>
  </section>

  <!-- 4 第2步 -->
  <section>
    <h2><span class="num">4</span>🧱 第 2 步 · 展示层：show_tasks</h2>
    <p>清单要「列」得漂亮：每个任务带编号（从 1 开始，对用户友好）、带状态符号，最后再来一行统计。三个老朋友登场：<span class="hl-c">enumerate(tasks, start=1)</span> 同时拿编号和元素、f-string 拼输出、<span class="hl-c">sum()</span> 统计已完成数量。</p>
    <div class="code">tasks = [
    {<span class="s">&quot;title&quot;</span>: <span class="s">&quot;学习变量&quot;</span>, <span class="s">&quot;done&quot;</span>: <span class="k">True</span>},
    {<span class="s">&quot;title&quot;</span>: <span class="s">&quot;闯过 BOSS 战&quot;</span>, <span class="s">&quot;done&quot;</span>: <span class="k">False</span>},
]

<span class="k">def</span> <span class="v">show_tasks</span>(tasks):
    <span class="s">&quot;&quot;</span><span class="s">&quot;列出所有任务&quot;</span><span class="s">&quot;&quot;</span>
    <span class="k">if</span> <span class="k">not</span> tasks:
        <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">&quot;清单空空如也，去添加一个任务吧！&quot;</span>)
        <span class="k">return</span>
    <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">&quot;=&quot;</span> * <span class="n">26</span>)
    <span class="k">for</span> i, task <span class="k">in</span> <span class="k">enumerate</span>(tasks, start=<span class="n">1</span>):
        mark = <span class="s">&quot;✔&quot;</span> <span class="k">if</span> task[<span class="s">&quot;done&quot;</span>] <span class="k">else</span> <span class="s">&quot;□&quot;</span>
        <span class="k">print</span>(f<span class="s">&quot;{mark} {i}. {task[&#x27;title&#x27;]}&quot;</span>)
    <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">&quot;=&quot;</span> * <span class="n">26</span>)
    done = <span class="k">sum</span>(<span class="n">1</span> <span class="k">for</span> t <span class="k">in</span> tasks <span class="k">if</span> t[<span class="s">&quot;done&quot;</span>])
    <span class="k">print</span>(f<span class="s">&quot;共 {len(tasks)} 项，已完成 {done} 项&quot;</span>)

<span class="v">show_tasks</span>(tasks)</div>
    <div class="out">==========================
✔ 1. 学习变量
□ 2. 闯过 BOSS 战
==========================
共 2 项，已完成 1 项</div>
    <p>小亮点：<span class="hl-c">"✔" if task["done"] else "□"</span> 是三元表达式——条件成立取前面的值，否则取后面的。一行顶四行。</p>
  </section>

  <!-- 5 第3步 -->
  <section>
    <h2><span class="num">5</span>🧱 第 3 步 · 操作层：add_task 添加</h2>
    <p>添加任务 = 往列表里 append 一个新字典。<span class="hl-c">strip()</span> 先把输入两端的空格和换行去掉，防止「手滑空格变空任务」；标题为空就直接拦截。</p>
    <div class="code"><span class="k">def</span> <span class="v">add_task</span>(tasks):
    title = <span class="k">input</span>(<span class="s">&quot;新任务标题：&quot;</span>).<span class="k">strip</span>()
    <span class="k">if</span> <span class="k">not</span> title:
        <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">&quot;标题不能为空&quot;</span>)
        <span class="k">return</span>
    tasks.<span class="k">append</span>({<span class="s">&quot;title&quot;</span>: title, <span class="s">&quot;done&quot;</span>: <span class="k">False</span>})
    <span class="k">print</span>(f<span class="s">&quot;已添加：{title}&quot;</span>)

tasks = []
<span class="v">add_task</span>(tasks)          <span class="c"># 此处输入：学会 json 模块</span>
<span class="k">print</span>(tasks)             <span class="c"># 看看盒子里的数据长什么样</span></div>
    <div class="out">已添加：学会 json 模块
[{'title': '学会 json 模块', 'done': False}]</div>
    <p>注意每个任务的骨架：<code class="hl-c">{"title": ..., "done": False}</code>——新任务默认未完成，等 done_task 来翻牌。</p>
  </section>

  <!-- 6 第4步 -->
  <section>
    <h2><span class="num">6</span>🧱 第 4 步 · 操作层：done_task / del_task</h2>
    <p>完成和删除都要「按编号」操作，而用户永远可能输入奇怪的东西：99、abc、空回车……防御三连：<span class="hl-c">isdigit()</span> 查是否纯数字、范围检查 <span class="hl-c">1 &lt;= int(num) &lt;= len(tasks)</span>、不合法就友好提示。删除用 <span class="hl-c">pop()</span>——它会顺手返回被删掉的元素，正好拿来播报。</p>
    <div class="code"><span class="k">def</span> <span class="v">done_task</span>(tasks):
    num = <span class="k">input</span>(<span class="s">&quot;要完成第几项？&quot;</span>).<span class="k">strip</span>()
    <span class="k">if</span> num.<span class="k">isdigit</span>() <span class="k">and</span> <span class="n">1</span> <= <span class="k">int</span>(num) <= <span class="k">len</span>(tasks):
        tasks[<span class="k">int</span>(num) - <span class="n">1</span>][<span class="s">&quot;done&quot;</span>] = <span class="k">True</span>
        <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">&quot;🎉 干得漂亮！&quot;</span>)
    <span class="k">else</span>:
        <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">&quot;编号无效&quot;</span>)

tasks = [
    {<span class="s">&quot;title&quot;</span>: <span class="s">&quot;学 Python&quot;</span>, <span class="s">&quot;done&quot;</span>: <span class="k">False</span>},
    {<span class="s">&quot;title&quot;</span>: <span class="s">&quot;打 BOSS&quot;</span>, <span class="s">&quot;done&quot;</span>: <span class="k">False</span>},
]
<span class="v">done_task</span>(tasks)         <span class="c"># 此处输入：1（合法编号）</span>
<span class="v">done_task</span>(tasks)         <span class="c"># 此处输入：99（越界编号）</span>
<span class="k">print</span>(tasks[<span class="n">0</span>])</div>
    <div class="out">🎉 干得漂亮！
编号无效
{'title': '学 Python', 'done': True}</div>
    <p>编号换算小陷阱：用户说「第 1 项」，Python 列表下标是 <span class="hl">0</span>，所以要 <code class="hl-c">int(num) - 1</code>。del_task 的写法完全同款，只是把 <code class="hl-c">= True</code> 换成 <code class="hl-c">pop(int(num) - 1)</code>（完整代码见第 8 步）。</p>
  </section>

  <!-- 7 第5步 -->
  <section>
    <h2><span class="num">7</span>🧱 第 5 步 · 调度层：while True 主菜单</h2>
    <p>万事俱备，只差总指挥。<span class="hl">while True</span> 死循环 + <span class="hl-c">break</span> 是命令行程序的标配骨架：不断接收命令、分发给对应函数，直到用户输入 quit 才存档退出。</p>
    <div class="code"><span class="k">def</span> <span class="v">main</span>():
    tasks = <span class="v">load_tasks</span>()          <span class="c"># 启动时读档（第 1 步）</span>
    <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">&quot;📋 欢迎使用命令行待办清单（输入 help 查看命令）&quot;</span>)
    <span class="k">while</span> <span class="k">True</span>:                   <span class="c"># 主循环：反复接收命令</span>
        cmd = <span class="k">input</span>(<span class="s">&quot;\n&gt; &quot;</span>).<span class="k">strip</span>().<span class="k">lower</span>()
        <span class="k">if</span> cmd == <span class="s">&quot;list&quot;</span>:
            <span class="v">show_tasks</span>(tasks)
        <span class="k">elif</span> cmd == <span class="s">&quot;add&quot;</span>:
            <span class="v">add_task</span>(tasks)
        <span class="k">elif</span> cmd == <span class="s">&quot;done&quot;</span>:
            <span class="v">done_task</span>(tasks)
        <span class="k">elif</span> cmd == <span class="s">&quot;del&quot;</span>:
            <span class="v">del_task</span>(tasks)
        <span class="k">elif</span> cmd == <span class="s">&quot;help&quot;</span>:
            <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">&quot;命令：add 添加 / list 列出 / done 完成 / del 删除 / quit 保存并退出&quot;</span>)
        <span class="k">elif</span> cmd == <span class="s">&quot;quit&quot;</span>:
            <span class="v">save_tasks</span>(tasks)     <span class="c"># 退出前存档</span>
            <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">&quot;已保存到&quot;</span>, TODO_FILE, <span class="s">&quot;，再见！&quot;</span>)
            <span class="k">break</span>                 <span class="c"># 跳出 while True，程序结束</span>
        <span class="k">else</span>:
            <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">&quot;未知命令，输入 help 查看用法&quot;</span>)

<span class="k">if</span> __name__ == <span class="s">&quot;__main__&quot;</span>:
    <span class="v">main</span>()</div>
    <div class="out session">📋 欢迎使用命令行待办清单（输入 help 查看命令）

&gt; help
命令：add 添加 / list 列出 / done 完成 / del 删除 / quit 保存并退出

&gt; add
新任务标题：喝口水
已添加：喝口水

&gt; xyz
未知命令，输入 help 查看用法

&gt; quit
已保存到 todo.json ，再见！</div>
    <p>细节：<span class="hl-c">strip().lower()</span> 让 "ADD"、"add " 都能被识别——把用户输入先洗干净再比较，是命令行程序的基本礼仪。</p>
  </section>

  <!-- 8 第6步 完整代码 -->
  <section>
    <h2><span class="num">8</span>⚔️ 第 6 步 · 神器合体：完整代码（88 行）</h2>
    <p>把前五步的零件组装起来，再补上 <span class="hl-c">load_tasks()</span> 的异常防御（文件不存在返回空列表、文件损坏自动重置）——神器成型：</p>
    <div class="code"><span class="k">import</span> <span class="k">json</span>
<span class="k">import</span> <span class="k">os</span>

TODO_FILE = <span class="s">&quot;todo.json&quot;</span>

<span class="k">def</span> <span class="v">load_tasks</span>():
    <span class="s">&quot;&quot;</span><span class="s">&quot;启动时读取 todo.json；文件不存在或损坏时返回空列表&quot;</span><span class="s">&quot;&quot;</span>
    <span class="k">if</span> <span class="k">not</span> <span class="k">os</span>.path.<span class="k">exists</span>(TODO_FILE):
        <span class="k">return</span> []
    <span class="k">try</span>:
        <span class="k">with</span> <span class="k">open</span>(TODO_FILE, <span class="s">&quot;r&quot;</span>, encoding=<span class="s">&quot;utf-8&quot;</span>) <span class="k">as</span> f:
            <span class="k">return</span> <span class="k">json</span>.<span class="k">load</span>(f)
    <span class="k">except</span> (<span class="k">json</span>.JSONDecodeError, OSError):
        <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">&quot;⚠️ 数据文件损坏，已重置为空清单&quot;</span>)
        <span class="k">return</span> []

<span class="k">def</span> <span class="v">save_tasks</span>(tasks):
    <span class="s">&quot;&quot;</span><span class="s">&quot;退出时把任务列表写回 todo.json&quot;</span><span class="s">&quot;&quot;</span>
    <span class="k">with</span> <span class="k">open</span>(TODO_FILE, <span class="s">&quot;w&quot;</span>, encoding=<span class="s">&quot;utf-8&quot;</span>) <span class="k">as</span> f:
        <span class="k">json</span>.<span class="k">dump</span>(tasks, f, ensure_ascii=<span class="k">False</span>, indent=<span class="n">2</span>)

<span class="k">def</span> <span class="v">show_tasks</span>(tasks):
    <span class="s">&quot;&quot;</span><span class="s">&quot;列出所有任务&quot;</span><span class="s">&quot;&quot;</span>
    <span class="k">if</span> <span class="k">not</span> tasks:
        <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">&quot;清单空空如也，去添加一个任务吧！&quot;</span>)
        <span class="k">return</span>
    <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">&quot;=&quot;</span> * <span class="n">26</span>)
    <span class="k">for</span> i, task <span class="k">in</span> <span class="k">enumerate</span>(tasks, start=<span class="n">1</span>):
        mark = <span class="s">&quot;✔&quot;</span> <span class="k">if</span> task[<span class="s">&quot;done&quot;</span>] <span class="k">else</span> <span class="s">&quot;□&quot;</span>
        <span class="k">print</span>(f<span class="s">&quot;{mark} {i}. {task[&#x27;title&#x27;]}&quot;</span>)
    <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">&quot;=&quot;</span> * <span class="n">26</span>)
    done = <span class="k">sum</span>(<span class="n">1</span> <span class="k">for</span> t <span class="k">in</span> tasks <span class="k">if</span> t[<span class="s">&quot;done&quot;</span>])
    <span class="k">print</span>(f<span class="s">&quot;共 {len(tasks)} 项，已完成 {done} 项&quot;</span>)

<span class="k">def</span> <span class="v">add_task</span>(tasks):
    title = <span class="k">input</span>(<span class="s">&quot;新任务标题：&quot;</span>).<span class="k">strip</span>()
    <span class="k">if</span> <span class="k">not</span> title:
        <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">&quot;标题不能为空&quot;</span>)
        <span class="k">return</span>
    tasks.<span class="k">append</span>({<span class="s">&quot;title&quot;</span>: title, <span class="s">&quot;done&quot;</span>: <span class="k">False</span>})
    <span class="k">print</span>(f<span class="s">&quot;已添加：{title}&quot;</span>)

<span class="k">def</span> <span class="v">done_task</span>(tasks):
    <span class="v">show_tasks</span>(tasks)
    <span class="k">if</span> <span class="k">not</span> tasks:
        <span class="k">return</span>
    num = <span class="k">input</span>(<span class="s">&quot;要完成第几项？&quot;</span>).<span class="k">strip</span>()
    <span class="k">if</span> num.<span class="k">isdigit</span>() <span class="k">and</span> <span class="n">1</span> <= <span class="k">int</span>(num) <= <span class="k">len</span>(tasks):
        tasks[<span class="k">int</span>(num) - <span class="n">1</span>][<span class="s">&quot;done&quot;</span>] = <span class="k">True</span>
        <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">&quot;🎉 干得漂亮！&quot;</span>)
    <span class="k">else</span>:
        <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">&quot;编号无效&quot;</span>)

<span class="k">def</span> <span class="v">del_task</span>(tasks):
    <span class="v">show_tasks</span>(tasks)
    <span class="k">if</span> <span class="k">not</span> tasks:
        <span class="k">return</span>
    num = <span class="k">input</span>(<span class="s">&quot;要删除第几项？&quot;</span>).<span class="k">strip</span>()
    <span class="k">if</span> num.<span class="k">isdigit</span>() <span class="k">and</span> <span class="n">1</span> <= <span class="k">int</span>(num) <= <span class="k">len</span>(tasks):
        removed = tasks.<span class="k">pop</span>(<span class="k">int</span>(num) - <span class="n">1</span>)
        <span class="k">print</span>(f<span class="s">&quot;已删除：{removed[&#x27;title&#x27;]}&quot;</span>)
    <span class="k">else</span>:
        <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">&quot;编号无效&quot;</span>)

<span class="k">def</span> <span class="v">main</span>():
    tasks = <span class="v">load_tasks</span>()
    <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">&quot;📋 欢迎使用命令行待办清单（输入 help 查看命令）&quot;</span>)
    <span class="k">while</span> <span class="k">True</span>:
        cmd = <span class="k">input</span>(<span class="s">&quot;\n&gt; &quot;</span>).<span class="k">strip</span>().<span class="k">lower</span>()
        <span class="k">if</span> cmd == <span class="s">&quot;list&quot;</span>:
            <span class="v">show_tasks</span>(tasks)
        <span class="k">elif</span> cmd == <span class="s">&quot;add&quot;</span>:
            <span class="v">add_task</span>(tasks)
        <span class="k">elif</span> cmd == <span class="s">&quot;done&quot;</span>:
            <span class="v">done_task</span>(tasks)
        <span class="k">elif</span> cmd == <span class="s">&quot;del&quot;</span>:
            <span class="v">del_task</span>(tasks)
        <span class="k">elif</span> cmd == <span class="s">&quot;help&quot;</span>:
            <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">&quot;命令：add 添加 / list 列出 / done 完成 / del 删除 / quit 保存并退出&quot;</span>)
        <span class="k">elif</span> cmd == <span class="s">&quot;quit&quot;</span>:
            <span class="v">save_tasks</span>(tasks)
            <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">&quot;已保存到&quot;</span>, TODO_FILE, <span class="s">&quot;，再见！&quot;</span>)
            <span class="k">break</span>
        <span class="k">else</span>:
            <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">&quot;未知命令，输入 help 查看用法&quot;</span>)

<span class="k">if</span> __name__ == <span class="s">&quot;__main__&quot;</span>:
    <span class="v">main</span>()</div>
    <p>使用方法：把代码保存为 <code class="hl-c">todo.py</code>，在终端运行 <code class="hl-c">python3 todo.py</code>。退出后同目录会出现 <code class="hl-c">todo.json</code>——那是你亲手封印的、遗忘魔龙再也吃不掉的数据。</p>
    <p>💡 检验持久化的黄金动作：<span class="hl">退出 → 重新启动 → list</span>。如果任务还在，恭喜，魔龙已被斩落。</p>
  </section>

